# ─── task: user-purge ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Standalone k8s CronJob. Removes users scheduled for deletion past the grace
# window along with their owned documents (Devices, plus any collections
# you add to UserPurgeTask). No HTTP, no RabbitMQ — direct MongoDB only.

NODE_ENV=production

MONGO=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/?directConnection=true
MONGO_DB=app-dev
